# native_corpus_nonrows.lst -- the names in tests/run_tests.sh that match the
# native corpus pattern (wine|windows|win_|_win|c7_) but are not suite rows
# (#143, A15-17 review finding 1). tests/windows/native_corpus_check.py (row
# native_corpus_matches_suite) requires every such name to be either a row
# in native_corpus.lst or listed here, so a new Windows row cannot be left
# out of the native corpus; an entry that no longer occurs in run_tests.sh
# fails as stale.

